          "title": "You'll want to know: পদক",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পদক — pôdôk — \"a medal\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সাঁতারে মেয়েটা একটা পদক জিতল। Sā̃tāre meyeṭā ekṭā pôdôk jitlô. The girl won a medal in swimming."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পদক (pôdôk) is a Sanskrit word built on pada; Monier-Williams gives padaka as a kind of ornament, and the sense \"a medal\" is the modern language's own."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
